{"source":"e4af8e4f8e8247d0bf167e23b4a8f1bc","folderId":"418ec5f164e5423788c19c2eaae5d43b","values":{"fullAppSettings":true,"basemapGalleryConfig":{"basemapIdsToFilter":[]},"searchConfiguration":{"searchAllEnabled":false,"allPlaceholder":"Kelder, adres of plaats zoeken","sources":[{"url":"https://geocoder.arcgisonline.nl/arcgis/rest/services/Geocoder_NL_RD/GeocodeServer","singleLineFieldName":"SingleLine","name":"Esri Nederland Geocoder","placeholder":"Adres of plaats zoeken","maxResults":6,"maxSuggestions":6,"suggestionsEnabled":true,"minSuggestCharacters":1,"withinViewEnabled":false,"countryCode":"","zoomScale":null,"_uid":"ea32beea165"}],"activeSourceIndex":0},"title":"Schaduw op het heetst van de dag","customHeader":false,"splash":false,"sidebarExpanded":true,"activePanel":"details","layerListPanel":true,"bookmarksPanel":false,"layerEditPanel":false,"detailsContent":"<p>We willen dat mensen op een hete dag in iedere straat in de schaduw kunnen lopen. Daarnaast willen we dat er voldoende koele plekken zijn. De aanwezigheid van schaduw is een belangrijke indicator voor het optreden van hittestress. Op deze kaart ziet u hoeveel schaduwplekken er zijn. De kaart is een momentopname van 21 juni om 15.00 uur - het heetste moment van de dag. Schaduw van bomen, gebouwen en andere bouwwerken is zichtbaar. Op 21 juni staat de zon op zijn hoogst, de hoeveelheid schaduw zal op die dag het minste zijn.</p><figure class=\"image\"><img src=\"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/c1aa9f961c4348f28aa741475ab7ef19/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1723023336733_detailsContent_textEditor_1723023336596.jpeg\"></figure><p>De gemeente Utrecht doet haar best om de informatie op deze kaart kloppend en actueel te houden. Komt u iets tegen wat niet klopt of sterk verouderd is, dan vinden wij het fijn als u ons dat laat weten. Dat kan via ons <a href=\"https://www.utrecht.nl/reactieformulier\" target=\"_blank\">reactieformulier</a> of bel 14 030.</p>","filterPanel":false,"basemapGallery":false,"enableFeatureSearchScale":false,"popupHover":false,"compassWidget":false,"locateWidget":true,"measure":false,"keyboardShortcuts":true,"disableScroll":false,"scalebarDualMode":false,"extentSelector":false,"enableHighlightColor":true,"enableHighlightHaloColor":true,"basemapToggle":false,"share":false,"customUrlParam":{"layers":[]},"panelSize":"m","theme":"light","customTheme":{"applySharedTheme":false,"applyPresetTheme":true,"font":"Arial","appFont":"Arial","logo":"https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/c88735ccb5394943907969a17cce05a8/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1712215481313_Utrecht_Logo.png","logoLink":"https://www.utrecht.nl/","logoScale":"m","preset":null,"themes":{"primary":{"type":"primary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"secondary":{"type":"secondary","background":"#FFFFFF","text":"#000000"},"accent":{"type":"accent","background":"#2964A3","text":"#ffffff"}}},"uploads":["https://gu-geo.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/c1aa9f961c4348f28aa741475ab7ef19/resources/media/instantAppsConfigPanel_1723023336733_detailsContent_textEditor_1723023336596.jpeg"],"compassWidgetPosition":{"position":"top-left","index":4},"locateWidgetPosition":{"position":"top-left","index":2},"keyboardShortcutsPosition":{"position":"top-left","index":5},"screenshotPosition":{"position":"top-left","index":3},"searchPosition":{"position":"top-right","index":0},"splashButtonPosition":{"position":"top-right","index":2},"filterConfig":{"mapId":"5295724c241342f990e1a046a3b9009c","layerExpressions":[{"id":"Werfkelders_20210305_4934","title":"Werfkelder","operator":" AND ","expressions":[{"id":1702461115748,"name":"Type Kelder","type":"string","field":"TYPE_KELDER","index":0,"_uid":"76701ea32be"}],"_uid":"876701ea32b"},{"id":"Werfkelders_20210305_4934_15","title":"Waterdicht gemaakte kelders","operator":" AND ","expressions":[{"definitionExpression":"SCOPE_WERVENPROGRAMMA = 'Ja'","id":1702461195097,"index":0,"name":"Sco